"palette.window.title" = "Roamling Colour";
"palette.header" = "Make Bori your own";
"palette.footer" = "Move a slider and the Bori on screen changes with it, and stays that way. A group you do not touch keeps the drawing exactly as it was — changing the body will not flatten the markings. To undo, press Start over, or pick Pet › Bori › Original from the menu.";
